  "id": 809,
  "description": "ShadowsEmbrace is a small group of long time gamer friends here to have fun. We encourage all new members to join our discord to keep up on the latest happenings from event strategy to guild raids.\n\nOnly requirements:\n\nWork on Challenges. \n\n-Completing Challenges let&#039;s us do more Raids! \nAs well as build the Guild Hall. All deputies will do our best to keep challenges up-to-date and will use refreshes to get as easy as possible challenges. \n\nDonate to the Stockpile. \n\n-We aren&#039;t asking you to give everything you have. Just what you can spare. We would like to still participate in guild events even if it&#039;s just for fun so we need resources for the Guild Hall.\n\nParticipate in Raids.\n\n-I know some may not be able to if we are running higher level raids but if you are able please participate. We will try to run a mix of all levels for everyone. Discord will have raid notifications, like time, place and level requirements.\n\n-Current raid schedule: \nEveryday at 1700(5pm CST) and 1810 (6:10pm CST)\n\nAt the end of the day we are here to have fun!\n\nDiscord link: https://discord.gg/mmpHcfPtGp",
